function migrateProfiles(){for(const p of db.profiles){if(p.progressionVersion!==2){p.previousMissions=p.missions?.length||0;p.worldProgress={};p.progressionVersion=2;p.currentMission=null;}p.worldProgress||={};p.settings={...DEFAULT_SETTINGS,...p.settings};p.missions||=[];p.stickers||=[];p.rewardDays||=[];p.wordStats||={};p.trainingCount||=0;p.grammarPlan||={};p.rewardWorlds||=[];p.rescuedCharacters||=[];for(const w of WORLD)if(rescued(p,w.id)&&!p.rescuedCharacters.includes(w.id))p.rescuedCharacters.push(w.id)}}
