function render(){const p=person();if(screen==='profiles'||!p){renderProfiles();return}if(screen==='new'){renderNew();return}if(screen==='game'&&game){renderGame();return}if(screen==='result'){renderResult();return}if(screen==='rank'){renderRank();return}if(screen==='album'){renderAlbum();return}if(screen==='parent'){renderParent();return}if(screen==='training'){renderTraining();return}renderHome()}
function renderProfiles(){screen='profiles';const entries=db.profiles.map(p=>`<button class="profilecard" data-action="choose-profile" data-id="${esc(p.id)}"><div class="face">${esc(p.avatar)}</div><strong>${esc(p.name)}</strong><div class="muted">Klasa ${p.grade} · ${p.points} pkt</div></button>`).join('');layout(`<section class="hero"><div><div class="kicker">Witaj w przygodzie!</div><h1>Kto dzisiaj odkrywa świat angielskiego?</h1><p>Wybierz swojego bohatera lub stwórz nowego odkrywcę.</p></div><div class="hero-art">🌈🦄</div></section><h2>Wybierz gracza</h2><div class="grid">${entries}<button class="profilecard" data-action="new"><div class="face">➕</div><strong>Nowy gracz</strong><div class="muted">Wybierz imię i bohatera</div></button></div>`)}
function renderNew(){screen='new';layout(`<section class="panel" style="max-width:700px;margin:auto"><div class="kicker">Twój bohater</div><h1>Stwórz odkrywcę ✨</h1><div class="formrow"><label for="player-name">Jak masz na imię?</label><input id="player-name" maxlength="24" placeholder="Wpisz imię lub pseudonim" autocomplete="off"></div><div class="formrow"><label for="player-grade">Którą klasę wybierasz?</label><select id="player-grade"><option value="1" ${selectedGrade===1?'selected':''}>Klasa 1 – Odkrywca</option><option value="2" ${selectedGrade===2?'selected':''}>Klasa 2 – Podróżnik</option><option value="3" ${selectedGrade===3?'selected':''}>Klasa 3 – Mistrz</option></select><div class="muted small">Dla dzieci uczących się już drugi rok polecamy rozpoczęcie od klasy 2. Poziom można później zmienić.</div></div><h3>Wybierz swojego bohatera</h3><div class="avatarrow">${AVATARS.map(a=>`<button class="avatar ${a===selectedAvatar?'selected':''}" data-action="avatar" data-avatar="${esc(a)}" aria-label="Bohater ${esc(a)}">${esc(a)}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="actions"><button class="button" data-action="create">🚀 Ruszamy!</button><button class="button secondary" data-action="profiles">Wróć</button></div></section>`)}
function unlocked(p){let n=0;for(let i=0;i<WORLD.length-1;i++){if(stageFor(p,WORLD[i].id)<STAGES.length)break;n=i+1}return n}
function renderHome(){screen='home';const p=person(),u=unlocked(p);applySettings();const nodes=WORLD.map((w,i)=>{const stage=stageFor(p,w.id),locked=i>u,done=stage===4;return `<div class="trail-stop ${i%2?'right':'left'}"><button class="trail-card ${locked?'locked':''} ${done?'done':''}" data-action="world" data-world="${w.id}" ${locked?'disabled':''}><div class="trail-meta"><span>Przystanek ${i+1}</span><span>${locked?'🔒 Zablokowane':done?'🏆 Uratowano!':STAGES[stage].title}</span></div><div class="trail-scene"><span>${w.emoji}</span><span>${HEROES[i][0]}</span></div><h3>${esc(w.name)}</h3><p>${esc(w.desc)}</p><p class="trail-character">${done?'💜 Uratowana postać:':'🗝️ Do uratowania:'} ${esc(HEROES[i][1])}</p><div class="trail-steps">${STAGES.map((s,j)=>`<span class="trail-step ${j<stage?'complete':j===stage&&!locked?'current':''}">${j<stage?'✓':s.icon}</span>`).join('')}</div><div class="progress"><span style="width:${stage*25}%"></span></div></button></div>`}).join('');
layout(`<section class="hero"><div><div class="kicker">Witaj, ${esc(p.name)}!</div><h1>${esc(p.avatar)} Wyprawa po zaginionych bohaterów!</h1><p>Przejdź cztery etapy krainy, uratuj bohatera i przejdź dalej. Na sprawdzianach wrócą też słowa ze starszych krain.</p><div class="actions"><button class="button gold" data-action="mixed">🌟 Wielka Przygoda – 25 pytań</button>${p.currentMission?'<button class="button secondary" data-action="resume">▶️ Wznów misję</button>':''}<button class="button secondary" data-action="quick">⚡ Rozgrzewka 10 pytań</button><button class="button secondary" data-action="album">📖 Księga Naklejek</button></div></div><div class="hero-art">${esc(p.avatar)}🗺️</div></section><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><b>${p.points}</b><small>Punkty</small></div><div class="stat"><b>${p.missions.length}</b><small>Misje</small></div><div class="stat"><b>${p.stickers.length}</b><small>Naklejki</small></div><div class="stat"><b>${WORLD.filter(w=>rescued(p,w.id)).length}/10</b><small>Uratowani bohaterowie</small></div></div><h2>🗺️ Plansza przygody</h2><section class="adventure-board">${nodes}</section><p class="topnote">4 misje na krainę: Odkrywca 18/25, Ekspert 21/25, Mistrz 22/25, Wielki Sprawdzian 22/25 i minimum 18 poprawnych za pierwszym razem. Bonus +5 minut za pierwsze uratowanie postaci w danej krainie.</p>`)}
function unique(list,key){const used=new Set();return list.filter(x=>{const v=typeof key==='function'?key(x):x[key];if(used.has(v))return false;used.add(v);return true})}
function pickWord(pool,used,p){const available=pool.filter(w=>!used.has(w.id));const choices=available.length?available:pool;const now=date();const weighted=choices.map(w=>{const s=p.wordStats[w.id];let weight=!s?6:s.nextReviewAt<=now?9:2;if(s&&s.correct===0)weight+=4;return {w,weight}});let roll=Math.random()*weighted.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.weight,0);for(const x of weighted){roll-=x.weight;if(roll<=0)return x.w}return rand(choices)}
function answerPool(w,grade=3){return unique(vocab.filter(x=>x.world===w.world&&x.grade<=grade&&x.id!==w.id),'en').filter(x=>x.pl.toLowerCase()!==w.pl.toLowerCase())}
function usablePictures(w,grade){return unique(answerPool(w,grade).filter(x=>PIC[x.en]&&PIC[x.en]!==PIC[w.en]),x=>PIC[x.en])}
function createQuestion(w,grade,index,stage=0,difficulty='normal'){
 const candidates=answerPool(w,grade),pics=usablePictures(w,grade).filter(x=>!AMBIGUOUS_PICTURES.has(x.en));
 let types=TASKS.filter(t=>!(t==='sentence'&&(grade<2||!SENTENCES[w.en]))
  &&!(t==='image-en'&&(!PIC[w.en]||AMBIGUOUS_PICTURES.has(w.en)||pics.length<3))
  &&!(t==='en-image'&&(!PIC[w.en]||AMBIGUOUS_PICTURES.has(w.en)||pics.length<3))
  &&!(t==='listen'&&!('speechSynthesis' in window))
  &&!(t==='missing'&&w.en.replace(/[^a-z]/ig,'').length<4)
  &&!(t==='order'&&(w.en.length>15||/[^a-z]/i.test(w.en))));
 if(index%5===0)types=types.filter(t=>t!=='sentence');
 const presets=[{'en-pl':6,'pl-en':5,'missing':4,'order':3,'image-en':5,'en-image':4,'listen':3,'sentence':1},{'en-pl':3,'pl-en':5,'missing':6,'order':6,'image-en':2,'en-image':2,'listen':4,'sentence':3},{'en-pl':1,'pl-en':4,'missing':8,'order':8,'image-en':1,'en-image':1,'listen':5,'sentence':5}];
 const weights=presets[Math.min(stage,2)];if(stage===3)types=types.filter(t=>t!=='image-en'&&t!=='en-image');const weighted=types.flatMap(t=>Array(Math.max(1,weights[t]+(difficulty==='easy'&&['en-pl','image-en'].includes(t)?5:0)+(difficulty==='challenge'&&['order','missing','sentence'].includes(t)?4:0))).fill(t));
 const type=rand(weighted)||'en-pl';let options=[],correct='',prompt='',display='',hint='';
 if(type==='en-pl'||type==='listen'){
  correct=w.pl;options=shuffle([correct,...shuffle(candidates).slice(0,3).map(x=>x.pl)]);
  prompt=type==='listen'?'Posłuchaj i wybierz polskie znaczenie':'Co po polsku znaczy to słowo?';
  display=type==='en-pl'?w.en:'🎧';hint='Pierwsza litera polskiego słowa: '+w.pl[0].toUpperCase();
 }
 if(type==='image-en'){
  correct=w.en;options=shuffle([w.en,...shuffle(pics).slice(0,3).map(x=>x.en)]);
  prompt='Co przedstawia obrazek? Wybierz po angielsku';display=PIC[w.en];
  hint='Angielskie słowo zaczyna się na: '+w.en[0].toUpperCase();
 }
 if(['pl-en','en-image','sentence'].includes(type)){
  correct=w.en;options=shuffle([w.en,...shuffle(type==='en-image'?pics:candidates).slice(0,3).map(x=>x.en)]);
  prompt=type==='en-image'?'Wybierz obrazek pasujący do słowa':type==='sentence'?'Wybierz brakujące słowo w zdaniu':'Jak to powiedzieć po angielsku?';
  display=type==='en-image'?w.en:type==='sentence'?SENTENCES[w.en]:w.pl;hint='Angielskie słowo zaczyna się na: '+w.en[0].toUpperCase();
 }
 if(type==='missing'){
  const indices=[...w.en].map((ch,i)=>/[a-z]/i.test(ch)?i:-1).filter(i=>i>0);
  const missing=rand(indices);correct=w.en[missing].toUpperCase();
  options=shuffle([correct,...shuffle('ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ'.split('')).filter(ch=>ch!==correct).slice(0,3)]);
  prompt='Wybierz brakującą literę';display=w.en.slice(0,missing)+' _ '+w.en.slice(missing+1);
  hint='Pierwsza litera słowa: '+w.en[0].toUpperCase();
 }
 if(type==='order'){
  correct=w.en.toUpperCase();options=shuffle(correct.slice(correct.length>6?correct.length-5:0).split(''));
  prompt='Ułóż angielskie słowo z liter';display=w.pl;hint='Pierwsza litera: '+correct[0];
 }
 if(options.length<4&&type!=='order'&&type!=='image-en'&&type!=='en-image'){
  for(const x of shuffle(unique(vocab.filter(x=>x.grade<=grade&&x.id!==w.id&&x.pl!==w.pl),'en'))){
   if(options.length>=4)break;
   const a=['en-pl','listen'].includes(type)?x.pl:type==='missing'?x.en[0].toUpperCase():x.en;
   if(!options.includes(a)&&a!==correct)options.push(a);
  }options=shuffle(options);
 }
 return {id:uuid(),wordId:w.id,type,options,correct,prompt,display,hint,fixedPrefix:type==='order'&&correct.length>6?correct.slice(0,correct.length-5):'',hiddenOptions:[],attempts:0,usedHint:false,finished:false};
}
function upgradeSavedQuestions(){
 for(const p of db.profiles){
  const m=p.currentMission;if(!m?.questions)continue;
  if(m.questions.some(q=>!vocab.some(v=>v.id===q.wordId&&v.grade<=p.grade))){p.currentMission=null;continue}
  for(const q of m.questions){
   if(q.finished)continue;
   const w=vocab.find(v=>v.id===q.wordId);
   if(q.type==='image-en'||q.type==='en-image'||q.type==='sentence'){
    const fresh=createQuestion(w,p.grade,1);
    Object.assign(q,fresh,{id:q.id,attempts:0,usedHint:false,finished:false});
   }
  }
 }
}

function newMission(world){const p=person();if(p.currentMission&&!confirm('Masz niedokończoną misję. Rozpocząć nową?'))return;const quick=world==='quick',mixed=world==='mixed',worlds=quick||mixed?WORLD.slice(0,unlocked(p)+1).map(w=>w.id):[world];const pool=vocab.filter(w=>worlds.includes(w.world)&&w.grade<=p.grade),count=quick?10:25;if(pool.length<count)return notify('Za mało słówek dla tego poziomu');const stage=quick||mixed?0:Math.min(STAGES.length-1,stageFor(p,world)),index=WORLD.findIndex(w=>w.id===world),priorIds=stage===3&&index>0?WORLD.slice(0,index).map(w=>w.id):[];const prevPool=vocab.filter(w=>priorIds.includes(w.world)&&w.grade<=p.grade),recapCount=Math.min(5,prevPool.length);const used=new Set(),words=[];for(let i=0;i<recapCount;i++){const w=pickWord(prevPool,used,p);used.add(w.id);words.push(w)}for(let i=recapCount;i<count;i++){const w=pickWord(pool,used,p);used.add(w.id);words.push(w)}const questions=shuffle(words).map((w,i)=>createQuestion(w,p.grade,i,stage,stage===3?'challenge':effectiveDifficulty(p)));game={id:uuid(),world,stage,quick,index:0,questions,hints:3,points:0,correct:0,first:0,second:0,withHint:0,answers:[],recapCount,createdAt:new Date().toISOString()};feedback=null;composing='';wrongChoice='';screen='game';persist();render()}
function current(){return game?.questions[game.index]}
function renderGame(){const p=person(),q=current();if(!q){screen='result';render();return}const w=vocab.find(v=>v.id===q.wordId);const name=game.quick?'Rozgrzewka':game.world==='mixed'?'Wielka Przygoda':WORLD.find(v=>v.id===game.world)?.name+' • '+STAGES[game.stage||0].title;let display=`<div class="target">${esc(q.display)}</div>`;if(q.type==='image-en')display=`<div class="question-art">${esc(q.display)}</div>`;if(q.type==='listen')display='<div class="target">🎧</div>';const translation=q.type==='missing'?`<div class="translation">(po polsku: ${esc(w.pl)})</div>`:'';let answers='';if(q.type==='order'){const letters=q.options;answers=`<div class="letterresult">${esc((q.fixedPrefix||'')+composing||'· · ·')}</div><div class="letterrow">${letters.map((l,i)=>`<button class="letter ${sequence.includes(i)?'used':''}" data-action="letter" data-i="${i}" ${q.finished||sequence.includes(i)?'disabled':''}>${esc(l)}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="actions" style="justify-content:center"><button class="button secondary sm" data-action="clear-letters" ${q.finished?'disabled':''}>↩️ Usuń litery</button><button class="button sm" data-action="check-letters" ${q.finished?'disabled':''}>Sprawdź ✓</button></div>`}else{answers=`<div class="answers">${(q.hiddenOptions?.length?q.options.filter(a=>!q.hiddenOptions.includes(a)):q.options).filter((a,i,arr)=>!p.settings.threeChoices||arr.length<=3||a===q.correct||i!==arr.findIndex(x=>x!==q.correct)).map(a=>`<button class="answer ${q.finished&&a===q.correct?'correct':a===wrongChoice?'wrong':''}" data-action="answer" data-value="${esc(a)}" ${q.finished||a===wrongChoice?'disabled':''}>${q.type==='en-image'?`<span style="font-size:44px">${esc(PIC[a]||'❓')}</span>`:esc(a)}</button>`).join('')}</div>`}
const milestone=q.finished&&(game.index+1)%5===0&&p.settings.celebrations?`<div class="milestone">${esc(p.avatar)} 🎊 Brawo! ${game.index+1} z ${game.questions.length} pytań!</div>`:'';const status=q.finished?(feedback?.success?`<div class="message good">${esc(feedback.text)}<br>+${feedback.points} pkt ${feedback.sticker||'🌟'}</div>`:`<div class="message bad">${esc(feedback?.text||'Poznaj prawidłową odpowiedź!')}<br>Poprawnie: ${esc(w.en)} — ${esc(w.pl)}</div>`):(q.attempts?'<div class="message bad">'+esc(feedback?.text||'Spróbuj jeszcze raz!')+'</div>':'');layout(`<div class="game-shell"><div class="game-top"><span class="pill">${esc(p.avatar)} ${esc(p.name)}</span><span class="pill">⭐ ${game.points} pkt</span><button class="button secondary sm" data-action="leave">✕ Zapisz i wyjdź</button></div><div class="game-panel" style="margin-top:15px"><div class="game-top"><b>${esc(name)}</b><span class="pill">Pytanie ${game.index+1}/${game.questions.length}</span></div><div class="bar"><span style="width:${(game.index+1)/game.questions.length*100}%"></span></div><div class="game-top"><span class="muted small">${q.attempts===0?'💜💜 2 próby':q.attempts===1?'💜 1 próba':'Odpowiedź zakończona'}</span><button class="button secondary sm" data-action="hint" ${q.finished||q.usedHint||game.hints===0?'disabled':''}>💡 Podpowiedź (${game.hints})</button></div>${q.usedHint?`<div class="notice">💡 ${esc(q.hint)}</div>`:''}<div class="question"><div class="kicker">${esc(['en-pl','listen','image-en'].includes(q.type)?'Rozpoznawanie':'Misja słówek')}</div><h1>${esc(q.prompt)}</h1>${display}${translation}<div class="pronunciation"><button class="button secondary speak-btn" data-action="speak">🔊 Odtwórz wymowę</button></div></div>${answers}${status}${milestone}${q.finished?`<div class="actions" style="justify-content:center"><button class="button" data-action="next">${game.index===game.questions.length-1?'🏆 Zobacz wynik':'Następne pytanie →'}</button></div>`:''}</div></div>`)}
function speak(w,rate=.78){if(!('speechSynthesis' in window))return notify('Brak dostępnego lektora');speechSynthesis.cancel();const u=new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(w.en);u.lang='en-GB';u.rate=rate;speechSynthesis.speak(u)}
function hint(){const q=current();if(q.finished||q.usedHint||game.hints<1)return;q.usedHint=true;game.hints--;if(q.type==='listen'){q.hint='Posłuchaj słowa wypowiedzianego wolniej';const w=vocab.find(x=>x.id===q.wordId);if(w)speak(w,.55)}else if(q.type==='order'){q.hint='Pierwsza litera to '+q.correct[0];if(!q.fixedPrefix){const index=q.options.indexOf(q.correct[0]);if(index>=0&&!sequence.includes(index)){sequence.push(index);composing=sequence.map(i=>q.options[i]).join('')}}}else if(q.type==='missing'){q.hint='Pozostawiono tylko dwie możliwe litery';q.hiddenOptions=q.options.filter(o=>o!==q.correct).slice(0,2)}else{q.hint='Usunięto dwie błędne odpowiedzi';q.hiddenOptions=q.options.filter(o=>o!==q.correct).slice(0,2)}persist();renderGame()}
function mark(answer){const q=current();if(!q||q.finished)return;const normalize=s=>String(s).normalize('NFKC').trim().toLocaleLowerCase('en');const ok=normalize(answer)===normalize(q.correct);q.attempts++;if(ok||q.attempts===2){q.finished=true;const points=ok?(q.usedHint?3:q.attempts===1?10:5):0;game.points+=points;if(ok){game.correct++;if(q.usedHint)game.withHint++;else if(q.attempts===1)game.first++;else game.second++}const sticker=ok?rand(STICKERS):'';feedback={success:ok,points,text:ok?pickComment(PRAISE,person()):pickComment(FAIL,person()),sticker};game.answers.push({wordId:q.wordId,type:q.type,correct:ok,attempts:q.attempts,usedHint:q.usedHint,points});wrongChoice='';sequence=[];composing='';if(q.type==='listen')try{speechSynthesis.cancel()}catch{}}else{feedback={text:pickComment(AGAIN,person())};wrongChoice=answer;sequence=[];composing=''}persist();renderGame()}
function updateWordStats(p,answers){for(const a of answers){let stat=p.wordStats[a.wordId]||{seen:0,correct:0,first:0,streak:0,interval:0,nextReviewAt:date(),types:{}};stat.seen++;const old=stat.types[a.type]||{correct:0,wrong:0};if(a.correct){stat.correct++;old.correct++;if(a.attempts===1&&!a.usedHint){stat.first++;stat.streak++;stat.interval=[1,3,7,14,30][Math.min(4,stat.streak-1)]}else{stat.streak=0;stat.interval=1}}else{old.wrong++;stat.streak=0;stat.interval=1}stat.types[a.type]=old;const due=new Date();due.setDate(due.getDate()+stat.interval);stat.nextReviewAt=due.toLocaleDateString('en-CA');p.wordStats[a.wordId]=stat}}
function finishMission(){const p=person();if(!game)return;if(p.missions.some(m=>m.id===game.id)){game=null;p.currentMission=null;screen='home';save();render();return}const oldBest=Math.max(0,...p.missions.map(m=>m.points||0));const stage=game.stage||0,quick=!!game.quick;const rule=STAGES[stage]||STAGES[0];const stagePassed=!quick&&game.world!=='mixed'&&game.correct>=rule.min&&game.first>=rule.first;const record={id:game.id,world:game.world,grade:p.grade,stage,stagePassed,quick,points:game.points,correct:game.correct,first:game.first,second:game.second,withHint:game.withHint,hintsUsed:3-game.hints,date:date(),recapCount:game.recapCount||0};updateWordStats(p,game.answers);if(quick){p.trainingCount++;p.lastReward={sticker:'📚',extraTime:false,record,newRecord:false};p.currentMission=null;game=null;save();screen='result';render();return}p.missions.push(record);p.points+=record.points;if(stagePassed)p.worldProgress[p.grade+':'+game.world]=Math.max(stageFor(p,game.world),stage+1);const rewardSticker=pickSticker(p,record.stage===3&&record.stagePassed);p.stickers.push({id:uuid(),sticker:rewardSticker,date:date(),world:record.world});p.rewardWorlds||=[];p.rescuedCharacters||=[];const firstRescue=stagePassed&&record.stage===3&&!p.rescuedCharacters.includes(record.world);if(firstRescue)p.rescuedCharacters.push(record.world);const eligible=firstRescue&&!p.rewardWorlds.includes(record.grade+':'+record.world);if(eligible)p.rewardWorlds.push(record.grade+':'+record.world);p.lastReward={sticker:rewardSticker,extraTime:eligible,record,newRecord:record.points>oldBest};p.currentMission=null;game=null;save();screen='result';render()}
function renderResult(){const p=person(),r=p.lastReward;if(!r){screen='home';render();return}const m=r.record,total=m.quick?10:25;const title=m.quick?'ROZGRZEWKA UKOŃCZONA!':m.correct===25?'DIAMENTOWA MISJA!':m.correct>=22?'ZŁOTA MISJA!':m.correct>=18?'SREBRNA MISJA!':'DOBRA PRACA!';const milestone=m.quick?'Ćwiczenia ukończone':m.world==='mixed'?'Misja mieszana':m.stagePassed?(m.stage===3?'🏆 Postać uratowana! Nowa kraina odblokowana!':'🔑 Etap zaliczony: '+STAGES[m.stage].title):'Etap do powtórzenia: '+STAGES[m.stage].title;layout(`<section class="panel center" style="max-width:780px;margin:auto"><div class="kicker">Gratulacje, ${esc(p.name)}!</div><div class="resulthero">${m.correct===25?'🏆🎉':'🎊'+p.avatar}</div><h1>${title}</h1><div class="score">${m.correct}/${total}</div><p class="muted">${m.points} punktów • ${milestone}</p>${m.stage===3&&!m.quick?`<div class="rescue-message">${m.stagePassed?'🎉 Uratowano:':'🔒 Czeka na ratunek:'} ${HEROES[WORLD.findIndex(w=>w.id===m.world)]?.[0]||''} ${esc(HEROES[WORLD.findIndex(w=>w.id===m.world)]?.[1]||'')}</div><p class="muted small">Sprawdzian zawierał ${m.recapCount||0} pytań z poprzednich krain.</p>`:''}${r.newRecord?'<div class="message good">🌟 Nowy rekord punktowy!</div>':''}<div class="stats"><div class="stat"><b>${m.first}</b><small>Za 1. razem</small></div><div class="stat"><b>${m.second}</b><small>Za 2. razem</small></div><div class="stat"><b>${m.withHint}</b><small>Z podpowiedzią</small></div><div class="stat"><b>${m.hintsUsed}</b><small>Podpowiedzi</small></div></div>${m.quick?'':`<h2>Nowa naklejka!</h2><div class="sticker">${esc(r.sticker)}</div>`}${r.extraTime?'<div class="message good">🎮 Masz dodatkowe 5 minut grania na tablecie!<p class="small">Pokaż nagrodę rodzicom.</p></div>':''}<div class="actions" style="justify-content:center"><button class="button" data-action="home">🗺️ Krainy</button><button class="button secondary" data-action="rank">🏆 Ranking</button></div></section>`)}
function renderRank(){screen='rank';const sorted=[...db.profiles].sort((a,b)=>b.points-a.points);layout(`<section class="hero"><div><div class="kicker">Sala sławy</div><h1>🏆 Ranking odkrywców</h1><p>Zdobywaj punkty w misjach i bij własne rekordy! Każdy bohater ma własną historię.</p></div><div class="hero-art">🥇</div></section><h2>Łączna liczba punktów</h2><section class="panel">${sorted.map((p,i)=>`<div class="rankrow"><div class="name"><span style="font-size:25px">${['🥇','🥈','🥉'][i]||'#'+(i+1)}</span><span style="font-size:40px">${esc(p.avatar)}</span><span>${esc(p.name)}<br><small class="muted">Klasa ${p.grade} · ${p.missions.length} misji · Rekord ${Math.max(0,...p.missions.map(m=>m.points))}/250</small></span></div><strong>${p.points} pkt</strong></div>`).join('')}</section>`)}
function renderAlbum(){screen='album';const p=person();const chapters=WORLD.map((w,i)=>{const unique=[...new Set(p.stickers.filter(s=>s.world===w.id).map(s=>s.sticker))];return `<section class="book-chapter"><div class="chapter-title"><span>${w.emoji}</span><div><h3>${esc(w.name)}</h3><p>${rescued(p,w.id)?'💜 Uratowano:':'🔒 Oczekuje na ratunek:'} ${HEROES[i][0]} ${esc(HEROES[i][1])}</p></div></div><div class="book-grid">${unique.length?unique.map((st,j)=>`<div class="book-sticker"><span>${esc(st)}</span><small>Nr ${j+1}</small></div>`).join(''):'<p class="muted">Tu pojawią się naklejki z tej krainy.</p>'}</div></section>`}).join('');const other=[...new Set(p.stickers.filter(s=>!WORLD.some(w=>w.id===s.world)).map(s=>s.sticker))];layout(`<section class="hero"><div><div class="kicker">Twoja kolekcja</div><h1>📖 Księga Skarbów</h1><p>Każda kraina ma swój rozdział, naklejki i własnego bohatera.</p></div><div class="hero-art">📚✨</div></section><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><b>${new Set(p.stickers.map(s=>s.sticker)).size}/${STICKERS.length}</b><small>Odkryte naklejki</small></div><div class="stat"><b>${WORLD.filter(w=>rescued(p,w.id)).length}</b><small>Uratowani bohaterowie</small></div></div><div class="sticker-book">${chapters}${other.length?`<section class="book-chapter"><h3>⭐ Inne przygody</h3><div class="book-grid">${other.map(st=>`<div class="book-sticker"><span>${esc(st)}</span></div>`).join('')}</div></section>`:''}</div>`)}
function renderTraining(){screen='training';const p=person(),due=Object.entries(p.wordStats).filter(([id,s])=>s.nextReviewAt<=date()).slice(0,40);layout(`<section class="panel"><div class="kicker">Tryb bez punktów</div><h1>📖 Album słówek i powtórki</h1><p>Rozgrzewka ma 10 pytań i nie daje dodatkowych minut, naklejek ani punktów do rankingu.</p><button class="button" data-action="quick">⚡ Rozgrzewka – 10 pytań</button><h2>Słówka do powtórzenia (${due.length})</h2>${due.map(([id,s])=>{const w=vocab.find(x=>x.id===id);return w?`<div class="wordstat"><span><b>${esc(w.en)}</b> – ${esc(w.pl)}<br><small class="muted">Poprawnie ${s.correct}/${s.seen}</small></span><button class="button secondary sm" data-action="speak-word" data-word="${esc(w.id)}">🔊</button></div>`:''}).join('')}<h2>Poznane słówka</h2>${Object.entries(p.wordStats).slice(0,150).map(([id,s])=>{const w=vocab.find(x=>x.id===id);return w?`<div class="wordstat"><span><b>${esc(w.en)}</b> – ${esc(w.pl)} · ${s.correct}/${s.seen}</span><button class="button secondary sm" data-action="speak-word" data-word="${esc(w.id)}">🔊</button></div>`:''}).join('')}</section>`)}
function renderParent(){screen='parent';const p=person();layout(`<section class="panel"><div class="kicker">Strefa rodzica</div><h1>⚙️ Ustawienia i bezpieczeństwo</h1><p class="muted">Dane są zapisywane lokalnie na tym urządzeniu. Aby je zabezpieczyć, pobierz kopię zapasową. Import nadpisuje obecne profile.</p><div class="actions"><button class="button" data-action="export">⬇️ Eksport kopii JSON</button><button class="button secondary" data-action="import">⬆️ Import kopii JSON</button><input type="file" accept="application/json,.json" id="import-file" class="hidden" /></div><div class="formrow" style="max-width:330px"><label for="grade-edit">Zmień poziom gracza ${esc(p.name)}</label><select id="grade-edit">${[1,2,3].map(n=>`<option value="${n}" ${p.grade===n?'selected':''}>Klasa ${n}</option>`).join('')}</select><button class="button secondary sm" data-action="grade-change">Zapisz poziom</button></div><div class="subtle"><b>Statystyki nauki</b><p>${Object.keys(p.wordStats).length} różnych słówek ćwiczonych · ${p.missions.length} ukończonych misji · ${p.points} punktów.</p><p class="small muted">Bonus +5 minut za pierwsze zaliczenie Wielkiego Sprawdzianu i uratowanie postaci. Raz na krainę, po zatwierdzeniu przez rodzica. To tylko informacja – aplikacja nie zmienia ustawień tabletu.</p></div><h2>📚 Program nauki – gramatyka</h2><p class="muted">Zaznacz, czego dziecko uczyło się w szkole. Na razie w pytaniach pozostają wyłącznie słówka, a poniższe statusy przygotują przyszłe zagadnienia.</p><div class="grammar-grid">${[1,2,3].map(grade=>`<section class="grammar-panel"><h3>Klasa ${grade}</h3>${GRAMMAR.filter(t=>t[2]===grade).map(t=>`<label class="grammar-topic"><span>${esc(t[1])}</span><select class="grammar-select" data-topic="${t[0]}"><option value="locked" ${grammarStatus(p,t[0])==='locked'?'selected':''}>Nie uczyliśmy się</option><option value="learning" ${grammarStatus(p,t[0])==='learning'?'selected':''}>W trakcie nauki</option><option value="review" ${grammarStatus(p,t[0])==='review'?'selected':''}>Utrwalamy</option><option value="mastered" ${grammarStatus(p,t[0])==='mastered'?'selected':''}>Opanowane</option></select></label>`).join('')}</section>`).join('')}</div><button class="button" data-action="save-grammar">💾 Zapisz program nauki</button><p class="muted small">Ustawienia dotyczą tylko bieżącego profilu. Nie zmieniają jeszcze pytań, punktacji ani odblokowanych krain.</p><h2>Ustawienia rozgrywki</h2><label class="setting">Trudność <select id="difficulty-edit"><option value="easy" ${p.settings.difficulty==='easy'?'selected':''}>Łatwa</option><option value="normal" ${p.settings.difficulty==='normal'?'selected':''}>Normalna (adaptacyjna)</option><option value="challenge" ${p.settings.difficulty==='challenge'?'selected':''}>Wyzwanie</option></select></label><label class="setting"><input type="checkbox" id="large-text" ${p.settings.largeText?'checked':''}> Większe litery</label><label class="setting"><input type="checkbox" id="reduced-motion" ${p.settings.reducedMotion?'checked':''}> Mniej animacji</label><label class="setting"><input type="checkbox" id="celebrations" ${p.settings.celebrations?'checked':''}> Pochwały co 5 pytań</label><label class="setting"><input type="checkbox" id="three-choices" ${p.settings.threeChoices?'checked':''}> 3 odpowiedzi zamiast 4</label><div class="actions"><button class="button secondary" data-action="save-settings">Zapisz ustawienia</button></div><div class="subtle version-panel"><b>📦 Wersja aplikacji: v${APP_VERSION}</b><p class="small muted">Sprawdź, czy na GitHub Pages jest nowsza wersja.</p><button class="button secondary sm" data-action="check-update">🔄 Sprawdź aktualizacje</button><div id="update-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div></div><h3>Usuwanie profilu</h3><button class="button danger sm" data-action="delete-profile">Usuń profil ${esc(p.name)}</button></section>`)}
function exportData(){const b=new Blob([JSON.stringify(db,null,2)],{type:'application/json'}),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(b);a.download=`english-adventure-backup-${date()}.json`;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href),1200)}
async function importData(f){try{const data=JSON.parse(await f.text());if(!data||!Array.isArray(data.profiles)||data.profiles.some(p=>!p.id||!Array.isArray(p.missions)||!p.wordStats))throw Error('Nieprawidłowy format');if(!confirm('Import zastąpi wszystkie aktualne profile i wyniki. Kontynuować?'))return;db=data;migrateProfiles();save();game=null;screen='profiles';render();notify('Kopia przywrócona')}catch(e){notify('Nie udało się wczytać kopii: '+e.message)}}
async function checkUpdates(){
 const box=document.querySelector('#update-status');
 if(box)box.textContent='Sprawdzam wersję…';
 try{
  const r=await fetch('./version.json?t='+Date.now(),{cache:'no-store'});
  if(!r.ok)throw Error('Offline');
  const v=await r.json();
  if(v.version===APP_VERSION){if(box)box.textContent='✅ Masz aktualną wersję v'+APP_VERSION;return}
  if(box)box.textContent='Dostępna wersja v'+v.version+'. Odśwież aplikację po aktualizacji.';
  if('serviceWorker'in navigator){const reg=await navigator.serviceWorker.getRegistration();await reg?.update();}
  if(box){const btn=document.createElement('button');btn.className='button sm';btn.textContent='🔄 Odśwież';btn.onclick=()=>location.reload();box.append(btn);}
 }catch(e){if(box)box.textContent='Nie można sprawdzić aktualizacji. Sprawdź połączenie z internetem.'}
}
function handle(action,el){const p=person();if(action==='profiles'){screen='profiles';game=null;render();return}if(action==='new'){screen='new';renderNew();return}if(action==='avatar'){selectedAvatar=el.dataset.avatar;document.querySelectorAll('.avatar').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('selected',b.dataset.avatar===selectedAvatar));return}if(action==='create'){const name=document.querySelector('#player-name')?.value.trim(),grade=Number(document.querySelector('#player-grade')?.value);if(!name)return notify('Wpisz imię lub pseudonim');if(name.length>24)return notify('Imię jest za długie');const n={id:uuid(),name,avatar:selectedAvatar,grade,points:0,missions:[],stickers:[],rewardDays:[],wordStats:{},currentMission:null,lastReward:null,progressionVersion:2,worldProgress:{},settings:{...DEFAULT_SETTINGS},grammarPlan:{},rewardWorlds:[],rescuedCharacters:[]};db.profiles.push(n);db.activeId=n.id;save();screen='home';render();return}if(action==='choose-profile'){db.activeId=el.dataset.id;game=db.profiles.find(x=>x.id===db.activeId)?.currentMission||null;save();screen='home';render();return}if(action==='home'){game=null;screen='home';render();return}if(action==='rank'||action==='album'||action==='parent'||action==='training'){screen=action;game=null;render();return}if(action==='mixed'){newMission('mixed');return}if(action==='quick'){newMission('quick');return}if(action==='world'){const id=el.dataset.world;if(WORLD.findIndex(w=>w.id===id)>unlocked(p))return;newMission(id);return}if(action==='resume'){game=p.currentMission;feedback=null;wrongChoice='';sequence=[];composing='';if(!game)return notify('Nie ma zapisanej misji');const q=current();if(q?.finished){const a=game.answers[game.answers.length-1];feedback={success:a?.correct,points:a?.points,text:a?.correct?'Brawo!':'Zobacz prawidłową odpowiedź!',sticker:'🌟'}}screen='game';render();return}if(action==='leave'){persist();game=null;screen='home';render();return}if(action==='hint'){hint();return}if(action==='speak'){const w=vocab.find(x=>x.id===current().wordId);if(w)speak(w);return}if(action==='speak-word'){const w=vocab.find(x=>x.id===el.dataset.word);if(w)speak(w);return}if(action==='answer'){mark(el.dataset.value);return}if(action==='letter'){const i=Number(el.dataset.i);if(sequence.includes(i))return;sequence.push(i);composing=sequence.map(i=>current().options[i]).join('');renderGame();return}if(action==='clear-letters'){sequence=[];composing='';renderGame();return}if(action==='check-letters'){if(sequence.length!==current().options.length)return notify('Ułóż najpierw wszystkie litery');mark((current().fixedPrefix||'')+composing);return}if(action==='next'){if(!current().finished)return;if(game.index===game.questions.length-1){finishMission();return}game.index++;feedback=null;wrongChoice='';sequence=[];composing='';persist();renderGame();return}if(action==='check-update'){checkUpdates();return}if(action==='export'){exportData();return}if(action==='import'){document.querySelector('#import-file')?.click();return}if(action==='save-grammar'){p.grammarPlan||={};document.querySelectorAll('.grammar-select').forEach(x=>{if(GRAMMAR.some(t=>t[0]===x.dataset.topic)&&GRAMMAR_STATES.includes(x.value))p.grammarPlan[x.dataset.topic]=x.value});save();notify('Program nauki zapisany');return}if(action==='save-settings'){p.settings={difficulty:document.querySelector('#difficulty-edit').value,largeText:document.querySelector('#large-text').checked,reducedMotion:document.querySelector('#reduced-motion').checked,celebrations:document.querySelector('#celebrations').checked,threeChoices:document.querySelector('#three-choices').checked};applySettings();save();notify('Zapisano ustawienia');return}if(action==='grade-change'){p.grade=Number(document.querySelector('#grade-edit').value);save();notify('Poziom zmieniony');return}if(action==='delete-profile'){if(!confirm(`Na pewno usunąć profil ${p.name} wraz z wynikami?`))return;db.profiles=db.profiles.filter(x=>x.id!==p.id);db.activeId=db.profiles[0]?.id||null;game=null;save();screen='profiles';render()}}
app.addEventListener('click',e=>{const el=e.target.closest('[data-action]');if(!el||el.disabled)return;handle(el.dataset.action,el)});
app.addEventListener('change',e=>{if(e.target.id==='import-file'&&e.target.files[0])importData(e.target.files[0])});
async function start(){load();try{const r=await fetch('./vocabulary.json');if(!r.ok)throw Error('Baza nie została pobrana');vocab=await r.json();if(!Array.isArray(vocab)||vocab.length<25)throw Error('Brak słówek');upgradeSavedQuestions();if(!db.profiles.length)screen='profiles';else if(!person())db.activeId=db.profiles[0].id;save();render();if('serviceWorker'in navigator&&location.protocol.startsWith('http'))navigator.serviceWorker.register('./sw.js').catch(()=>{});}catch(e){app.innerHTML=`<div class="panel"><h1>Nie udało się wczytać gry 😕</h1><p>${esc(e.message)}</p><p>Uruchom aplikację przez GitHub Pages lub lokalny serwer HTTP. Bezpośrednie otwieranie pliku index.html może blokować odczyt danych.</p></div>`}}
start();
